{"product_id":"pod-salt-freebase-cuban-creme","title":"Pod Salt Freebase - Cuban Creme","description":"\u003cp\u003ePod Salt Freebase Cuban Creme 60ml is a premium blend that captures the bold essence of Cuban tobacco infused with a velvety cream finish. Designed for vapers who crave a smooth yet robust tobacco profile, this e-liquid delivers deep flavor and satisfying nicotine hits. Available in 3mg and 6mg, it comes in a Gorilla bottle, ensuring freshness and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour Profile: Cuban Tobacco with Creamy Notes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60ml Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFreebase Formula: Strong flavor, smooth throat hit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExperience: Rich, creamy, and satisfying tobacco blend\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal For: Tobacco lovers looking for a premium creamy twist\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAroma: Warm, smooth, and full-bodied\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41991066222647,"sku":"Pod S - Cuban Creme - 3 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41991066255415,"sku":"Pod S - Cuban Creme - 6 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-freebase-eliquid-cuban-creme.webp?v=1763437347","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-freebase-cuban-creme","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




